Uncertain | \u2191/\u2193 |\n\n---\n\n## SECTION 7.5 \u2014 CORRELATION-ADJUSTED RISK\n\n### Common Bear Triggers Across Portfolio\n\n| Trigger | KMDA Sensitivity | Cross-Portfolio Impact |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Rising real yields** (10Y TIPS > 2.6%) | High (DCF discount rate sensitivity) | Portfolio-wide \u2014 moderate negative |\n| **Risk-off global liquidity crunch** | Moderate (small-cap, Israeli jurisdiction) | Portfolio-wide \u2014 negative |\n| **USD strengthening** | Low (USD revenue, ILS costs | Marginal positive for earnings hedges |\n| **Healthcare policy/pricing pressure** | Moderate (specialty drug pricing scrutiny) | Sector-specific \u2014 negative |\n\n### Tail Correlation / CVaR\n- Historical stress correlation (2020, 2022) likely **0.5\u20130.7** for a small-cap U.S.-listed Israeli pharma vs the S&P 500 [Assumption].\n- **Conditional VaR (95%) estimate:** In a simultaneous equity sell-off (\u221220% S&P) + widening of credit spreads + high-beta compression, KMDA could decline **25\u201335%** [Estimate] due to its micro-cap liquidity and a selling of \"paper emerging-market\" ADRs.\n- Suggested hedges: small allocation to long-duration treasuries or index puts if the macro regime shifts to Stagflation.\n\n---\n\n## SECTION 8 \u2014 MONITORING RULES\n\n### Thesis Integrity KPIs (threshold-based)\n\n| KPI | Current | Trigger for Re-Evaluation | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Revenue vs 2026 guidance ($200\u2013205M) | On track (H1 \u2248 50% of midpoint) [Estimate] | **Below $198M** | Company disclosure |\n| 2027 revenue growth commentary | \"Double-digit\" [Estimate] | **Below 8% commentary or guidance < $215M** | Q1\u2013Q4 2027 calls |\n| Adjusted EBITDA margin | 26% H1 2026 [Estimate] | **Falls below 22%** for two quarters | Company disclosure |\n| Gross margin | ~42\u201347% (mixed product) [Estimate] | **Consistent decline > 300bp YoY** | Company disclosure |\n| Working capital | Inventory $85M FY2025 [Actual] | **Inventory > 100% of revenue** or 